cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SPASS Converter"
abstract: >
  An offline Android app that decrypts Samsung Pass .spass password export files
  and converts them to a standard CSV format compatible with Google Password Manager,
  Chrome, Bitwarden, 1Password, and other password managers. All decryption and
  conversion happens entirely on-device; no data ever leaves the phone.
authors:
